    "name": "v3.4.1 · CI 可诊断性：修浏览器定位静默回退、汇总加断言总数、新增环境体检与自诊断守护",
    "draft": false,
    "immutable": false,
    "prerelease": false,
    "created_at": "2026-09-18T13:10:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-19T01:40:06Z",
    "published_at": "2026-09-19T01:40:06Z",
