    "name": "v3.1.0 · 被照面半径 R 自动跟随 h·tan θ½，移除「按半光强光斑填充」",
    "draft": false,
    "immutable": false,
    "prerelease": false,
    "created_at": "2026-09-17T08:14:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-17T08:15:27Z",
